    "sentence_translations": [
      "",
      "“It’s not your money, it’s the watch. I got out to look for the watch, and one minute later, I returned to the taxi.",
      "But for some reason, lots and lots of cars pulled up beside the taxi. The cars stopped beside us, so we couldn’t move.",
      "We waited for two hours in the taxi. In these two hours, we talked about very, very many things.",
      "I said to Little Mi, “I like you.” And you know what? She said she also liked me!”",
      "Li Fei was so happy that he couldn’t stop talking.",
      "",
      "Li Han smiled and said, “Really? That’s great!”",
      "",
      "“Dad, don’t tell me that ‘money can buy everything’. This saying is incorrect!",
      "You see, me and Little Mi being together is not something that money can buy. Money can’t buy ‘love’.”",
      "",
      "Li Han smiled, and didn’t say anything.",
      ""
